sequenceDiagram
  actor ResidentA as Resident changing attendance
  participant AxiosA as Axios agent
  participant EventsAPI as EventsController
  participant AttendanceAPI as AttendanceController
  participant Service as Attendance service
  participant SQL as Azure SQL
  participant Broker as In-memory event broker
  participant Stream as Authenticated SSE endpoint
  participant EventSource as Other browser EventSource
  participant Query as TanStack Query
  participant Page as Event details page

  Page->>Query: useEvent and useAttendees
  par Event detail
    Query->>EventsAPI: GET /api/events/id
    EventsAPI-->>Query: Event JSON
  and Attendee list when admin query is enabled
    Query->>AttendanceAPI: GET /api/attendance/id
    AttendanceAPI-->>Query: Attendee JSON
  end
  Query-->>Page: Render cached snapshots

  EventSource->>Stream: GET /api/events/id/stream with cookie
  Stream->>Stream: Authorize and check event visibility
  Stream->>Broker: SubscribeAsync(eventId, RequestAborted)
  Note over SQL,Stream: One bounded channel per browser - capacity 1 - drop oldest

  ResidentA->>AxiosA: Join or leave event
  AxiosA->>AttendanceAPI: POST /api/attendance/id/join or DELETE /api/attendance/id/leave
  Note over AxiosA,AttendanceAPI: Browser sends cookie and Axios attaches CSRF header
  AttendanceAPI->>Service: JoinEventAsync or LeaveEventAsync
  Service->>SQL: SaveChangesAsync
  SQL-->>Service: Commit succeeds
  Service->>Broker: Publish attendance-changed
  Broker-->>Stream: Fan out update for this event
  Stream-->>EventSource: event attendance-changed plus JSON data
  EventSource->>Query: Invalidate event, events, and attendees keys
  par Active event queries
    Query->>EventsAPI: Refetch GET /api/events and /api/events/id
    EventsAPI-->>Query: Fresh event JSON
  and Enabled admin attendee query
    Query->>AttendanceAPI: Refetch GET /api/attendance/id
    AttendanceAPI-->>Query: Fresh attendee JSON
  end
  Query-->>Page: Re-render current data

  alt Browser disconnects or changes event
    EventSource-xStream: Close connection
    Stream->>Broker: RequestAborted removes subscription
  else Network reconnects
    EventSource->>Stream: Browser reconnects automatically
    EventSource->>Query: Later open invalidates all three keys
  end

  Note over Broker,EventSource: Scale limit: one API instance until a shared backplane
